            "text": "<p>Hestan makes its stainless steel cookware in its own factories in Italy. Every line is fully clad, works on every cooktop including induction, and has flush rivets, so there's nothing on the cooking surface for food to stick to. At The Cook's Station we carry NanoBond, ProBond, CopperBond, TITUM nonstick and Hestan Provisions. Shop by line below, or visit our Buncombe Street shop in Greenville to pick up a pan and feel the balance before you buy.</p>"
