    "rich_text_guide": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "guide_h": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which Hestan Line Is Right for You?",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "guide_t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>NanoBond</strong> is Hestan's top line. Thousands of titanium nano-layers are bonded onto the stainless steel, so the surface is harder than standard stainless and resists scratches and staining. It's oven- and broiler-safe to 1050°F. Choose it if you want the most durable pan Hestan makes.</p><p><strong>ProBond</strong> (including the mirror-polished <strong>ProBond Luxe</strong>) is tri-ply stainless steel with an aluminum core. It's oven-safe to 600°F and dishwasher-safe. Choose it for everyday searing, sautéing and pan sauces at the best value.</p><p><strong>CopperBond</strong> has a pure copper core wrapped in stainless steel. Copper responds to heat faster than any other cookware metal, and the stainless exterior still works on induction. It's oven-safe to 600°F. Hand wash it to keep the copper bright. Choose it for precise temperature control.</p><p><strong>TITUM nonstick</strong> puts Hestan's diamond-reinforced nonstick coating on a clad stainless steel body. It's oven-safe to 500°F and dishwasher-safe. Choose it for eggs, fish and easy cleanup.</p><p><strong>Hestan Provisions</strong> includes roasters, griddles, inserts and lids that round out a Hestan kitchen.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "guide_h",
        "guide_t"
      ],
